  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It's both possible and easy to create world thumbnails/images of any arbitary image, and in some cases having that as the world's logo (if it has one) is fine.\n\nWhat is not fine is when this image is misleading in some way.\n\nThe solution is to have two world images. The worlds list thumbnail image, that is only bound by the usual content rules. (so the same as it is currently)\nAnd a second mandatory world image of part of the world itself. This would only appear on the details panel. If this one is found to be misleading then moderation action could be taken in some way.",
